<BaseLayout title="AI Business Playbooks for Research, Marketing and Strategy" description="Practical AI playbooks connecting human judgement and artificial intelligence to research, marketing, knowledge work and business decisions."><header class="page-hero"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Practical AI for business</p><h1>Make AI useful for the work that matters</h1><p class="lead">The business value of AI comes from redesigning useful work—not from adding another tool.</p></div></header><section><div class="wrap"><div class="cards"><article class="card"><h2>Research</h2><p>AI-assisted discovery, synthesis and interpretation with clear evidence and review boundaries.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Market intelligence</h2><p>Repeatable workflows that organise signals without confusing speed for judgement.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Content systems</h2><p>Structured knowledge-to-content workflows that preserve a credible human point of view.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Decision support</h2><p>Practical frames for exploration while keeping accountability with the decision-maker.</p></article></div><div class="actions">{site.stripe!='#'?<a class="button" href={site.stripe}>Explore available playbooks</a>:<a class="button" href="/contact/">Ask about available playbooks</a>}<a class="button secondary" href={site.aiUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit dedicated AI website ↗</a></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
